233] py-2 px-5 z-[0]\"><div itemscope=\"\" itemType=\"https://schema.org/FAQPage\"><div itemscope=\"\" itemProp=\"mainEntity\" itemType=\"https://schema.org/Question\" class=\"[content-visibility:auto] [contain-intrinsic-size:auto_242px] gap-2 flex flex-col h-auto  border-b border-card-border px-0 pt-0 pb-3\" style=\"content-visibility:auto;contain-intrinsic-size:auto 242px\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center leading-[0]\"><div itemProp=\"name\" class=\"flex-[10] select-none text-base font-pn-600 leading-[1.5]\" data-testid=\"faq-question\">What is the salary of a Data Scientist in India?</div></div><div class=\"max-h-[unset] overflow-visible font-pn-400 text-sm leading-[1.25] color-primary-text \" itemscope=\"\" itemProp=\"acceptedAnswer\" itemType=\"https://schema.org/Answer\"><div class=\"[&amp;_a]:cursor-pointer [&amp;_a]:font-pn-600 [&amp;_a]:text-primary hover:[&amp;_a]:text-[#4158d4] [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:list-outside [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li]:mb-[2px] [&amp;_li]:leading-5\" itemProp=\"text\" data-testid=\"faq-answer\">The salary of a Data Scientist in India varies based on experience, location, company &amp; Industry. \\n      The average salary for a Data Scientist is ₹16.1 Lakhs per year (₹1.3L per month) with 1 year of experience. Top companies and specialized roles may offer higher compensation.\\n      <br /> <br />The average starting salary is around \\n      ₹16.1 Lakhs  per year, with the highest salary reaching ₹66.2 Lakhs  per year. The top 10% of Data Scientists in India earn more than ₹25.2 Lakhs per year, and the top 1% earn over ₹43.9 Lakhs per year. Salary estimates are based on 61.6k salaries received from various Data Scientists across industries.</div></div></div><div itemscope=\"\" itemProp=\"mainEntity\" itemType=\"https://schema.org/Question\" class=\"[content-visibility:auto] [contain-intrinsic-size:auto_242px] gap-2 flex flex-col h-auto  border-b border-card-border px-0 pt-3 pb-3\" style=\"content-visibility:auto;contain-intrinsic-size:auto 242px\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center leading-[0]\"><div itemProp=\"name\" class=\"flex-[10] select-none text-base font-pn-600 leading-[1.5]\" data-testid=\"faq-question\">What are the top paying companies that employ Data Scientists?</div></div><div class=\"max-h-[unset] overflow-visible font-pn-400 text-sm leading-[1.25] color-primary-text \" itemscope=\"\" itemProp=\"acceptedAnswer\" itemType=\"https://schema.org/Answer\"><div class=\"[&amp;_a]:cursor-pointer [&amp;_a]:font-pn-600 [&amp;_a]:text-primary hover:[&amp;_a]:text-[#4158d4] [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:list-outside [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li]:mb-[2px] [&amp;_li]:leading-5\" itemProp=\"text\" data-testid=\"faq-answer\">Data Scientist Salaries at Top paying companies in India are <div>\\n      <table>\\n       \\n        <tbody>\\n        <tr>\\n            <td>\\n              <a class=\"ctas-a-medium\" style=\"text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#4E68F4\" href=\"/salaries/atlassian-salaries/data-scientist\">\\n              Atlassian Data Scientist Salary\\n              </a>\\n            </td>\\n            <td>\\n      ₹66.2 Lakhs per year\\n      </td>\\n            </tr><tr>\\n            <td>\\n              <a class=\"ctas-a-medium\" style=\"text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#4E68F4\" href=\"/salaries/coursera-salaries/data-scientist\">\\n              Coursera Data Scientist Salary\\n              </a>\\n            </td>\\n            <td>\\n      ₹42.8 Lakhs per year\\n      </td>\\n            </tr><tr>\\n            <td>\\n              <a class=\"ctas-a-medium\" style=\"text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#4E68F4\" href=\"/salaries/facebook-salaries/data-scientist\">\\n              Facebook Data Scientist Salary\\n              </a>\\n            </td>\\n            <td>\\n      ₹41.8 Lakhs per year\\n      </td>\\n            </tr><tr>\\n            <td>\\n          